tmp_*.diff
tmp_*.patch
issues.jsonl

# Python bytecode from script tests
__pycache__/

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.beads/proxieddb/
.beads.backup-*

# Gas City — entries gc itself writes into a checkout it manages.
# Tracked here on purpose: `gc rig add` (rigGitignoreEntries) and the
# project-MCP prestart (managedMCPGitignoreEntries, written into each agent's
# work_dir) both append whatever is missing. When this repo is a Gas City rig
# its own work_dir IS this checkout, so an absent entry means a tracked
# .gitignore edit on every boot — and the town's canonical-checkout reconcile
# refuses to fast-forward a tree with tracked changes, which crash-loops the
# pod. Listing them makes those writers no-ops (ensureGitignoreEntries only
# appends entries not already present).
.beads/*
!.beads/identity.toml
.mcp.json
.gemini/settings.json
.codex/config.toml
.cursor/mcp.json
opencode.json
